Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:36:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] hbbs: the shared vectors with access.conf lines that lack
 their =

The copy of hjviewer's server/api/tests/vectors/access-tickets.json is
the one its generator now makes: there, too, a line that is neither a
comment nor NAME=value is an error (a bare KEY under MODE=off, a bare
NOT_BEFORE), as this parser already reads it (docs/access-tickets.md
6-2), with two cases more for it, 41 access.conf files in all.
VECTORS_SHA256 follows the file.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UGRoRVHEhxg8GAbP842qdV
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/hjv_access.rs                 | 10 +++++-----
 tests/vectors/access-tickets.json | 12 ++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

